  "description": "Every log line the screenshare pod writes, organized for debugging: one panel per container, the warnings and errors pulled out, report intake and the pod's Kubernetes events beside them. The Filter box narrows every stream panel with a LogsQL word, phrase or field filter. Metrics live on MirrorMe Insights.",
